    <string name="setting_hold_notifications_summary">They leave the notification shade and come back when the pause ends. Calls, alarms and anything ongoing always get through. A sound may still play as one arrives.</string>
    <string name="hold_full_build_only">Holding notifications from paused apps needs the full version of Haven (from app stores, or the \"-full\" APK), because it uses notification access.</string>
